 relay, ran out of the exchange zone, getting the US team disqualified. With Norton off form, Italy pinned its hopes on " [:a {:href "/athletes/71860"} "Livio Berruti"] ", who had been the only runner to defeat Norton over 200 in 1959. Before the Roma crowd, he won a wildly received gold medal, holding off American " [:a {:href "/athletes/78199"} "Les Carney"] " down the straight. In fifth place was " [:a {:href "/athletes/78619"} "Stone Johnson"] " who turned to pro football in 1963. Playing for the Kansas City Chiefs in an exhibition game in 1963, he sustained a broken neck and died 10 days later."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "QF"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "596"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/71860"} "Livio Berruti"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ITA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ITA.png"}] "ITA"]] [:td {} "21.0 (1 h7)"] [:td {} "20.8 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "20.5 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "20.5 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "398"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/78199"} "Les Carney"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "21.1 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "20.9 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "21.1 (3 h1)"] [:td {} "20.6 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "465"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/68502"} "Abdou Sèye"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central